      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Logging Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Logging as the managed logging service. I'm focusing on how to make the provider choice explicit within the `write_structured_log.py` file, so the code is clear about the target logging infrastructure.\n\n\n**Defining Code Structure**\n\nI am now structuring the `write_structured_log.py` file. I'm focusing on making the Google Cloud Logging provider choice crystal clear within the Python code. I am proceeding by importing the necessary libraries, initializing a logging client, and crafting a structured log entry. I'm aiming for clean, explicit code.\n\n\n",
